WEBVTT

00:16:29.317 --> 00:16:32.654
do <i>campus </i>da ELA em Cabul,

00:16:32.654 --> 00:16:35.699
com todas as minhas alunas.

00:16:36.950 --> 00:16:39.286
Ver-vos-ei nessa altura,

00:16:39.327 --> 00:16:40.829
se não desviarem o olhar.

00:16:40.829 --> 00:16:42.122
Obrigada.

00:16:42.247 --> 00:16:48.003
(Aplausos)